silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_08_sections_02_concrete_anchor_4#bodymassquality77 silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassQuality77 is an example pre-existing leg that silent-deletion would destroy. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BodyMassQuality77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
